  - 3. KINU - This means to move something quickly back and forth or up and down.
  - 6. AWLA - This is a type of fish found in local waters.
  - 7. TIKI - This is a small lizard often seen clinging to walls and ceilings.
  - 9. KIMPI - This describes someone whose knees touch while their ankles stay apart
    when standing.
